er":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Encounter at the Necropolis","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-10-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=I%27m%20telling%20you%20that%20your%20leadership%20is%20over.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","license":null,"text":"\"Encounter at the Necropolis\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Oct 2008. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21-e7","era":null,"summary":"Eliza draws her fire-sword, which bursts into flame, and Sedris taunts her to do her worst.","participants":["eliza","sedris","eliza-s-fire-sword"],"location":"unx","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","order":159,"story_date":"2008-10-21","storyline":"Shards of Alara","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":34,"quote":"With that, Eliza drew her sword.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=With%20that%2C%20Eliza%20drew%20her%20sword.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Encounter at the Necropolis","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2008-10-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/encounter-necropolis-2008-10-21#:~:text=With%20that%2C%20Eliza%20drew%20her%20sword.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211208103941/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavo